  {
   "id": "leafy-corner-363341@major-2025-12-08",
   "gameId": "leafy-corner-363341",
   "displayName": "Leafy Corner 🍃 Decemeber Developement Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-08T18:31:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We wanted to share a few exciting updates about Leafy Corner. 🍃",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many of you have been asking whether the game will include variegated plants, so... we added them to the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They have a small chance to appear when you plant normally, and you can’t simply purchase them the same way you buy regular plants. We hope this makes discovering them feel more exciting!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For the last month, we were also working on controller support (the game is now fully playable with a controller!), and we ran the game on Steam Deck for the first time. Reaching that milestone helped us confirm that the game already works well on a handheld, and we’re now focused on refining the experience for the next round of playtests.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are also filling the game with more content, including new plants and decorations, but there is still a lot to come.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for all your support. We will keep working on improving the game so stay tuned for more updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Take care,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kasia & Kacper 💚",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
